# Enterprising Scallywag: you descended "if a permanent card was put into your graveyard from anywhere" (CR 700.11), a discard included.
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts it, then Faithless Looting (drawing two Plains) discards an Ornithopter and a Plains: Bot1 descended and the end-step
# trigger makes a Treasure (CR 111.10a). The Faithless Looting itself, a sorcery, would not count alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mountain
Enterprising Scallywag
Faithless Looting
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enterprising Scallywag.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Plains)
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Token = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Plains; Ornithopter
